    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44372" root="&#xA;                        هون&#xA;                    " body-key="h1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَانَ</span></b> 
                        , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَوَانٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُونٌ</span> (Msb, K) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَهَانَةٌ</span>, (K,) <i>He,</i> or <i>it, was,</i> or <i>became, low, base,
vile, abject, mean, paltry, contemptible, despicable, ignominious, inglorious,</i> and <i>weak;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَلَّ</span>,
(Msb, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَقُرَ</span>, (Msb,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَعُفَ</span>. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَانَ عَلَيْهِ</span> [<i>It was of light estimation to him</i>]
<i>It</i> (a thing) <i>was</i> [<i>easy and</i>] <i>light to him.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَانَ</span> also, <i>He,</i> or <i>it, was,</i> or <i>became, gentle,</i>
and <i>easy.</i> (Msb.)

